        "created_at": "2019-07-22T06:29:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>question about 'outpaced' and 'Missionaries Arrive' question.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>'outpaced' dahan event is '&nbsp;Raids in Force: Each Spirit chooses a differend land where Dahan outnumber Town / City. Each Dahan there does 1 Damage.'</p>\n<p>this is 'dahan damage to town/city'? or 'event card damage to dahan'?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>'Missionaries Arrive' second option is 'During the next normal Ravage, City do +3 Damage.'</p>\n<p>this is 'During the next normal Ravage, when every now ravage&nbsp;each&nbsp;city&nbsp;each&nbsp;6 damage to dahan and land'?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:58.313Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
